<title>USA: Donnelley Enterprise gets $10 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Donnelley Enterprise gets $10 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnelley Enterprise Solutions Inc said Monday it signed a technology systems management outsourcing contract with the law firm of Brown &amp; Wood.  It said the contract is valued at more than $10 million in revenue over a five-year period.</p>
<p>Donnelley Enterprise provides business service outsourcing to Brown &amp; Wood under a separate agreement.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
